# The full benchmark rows are rebuilt from the pinned run package by
# `python -m benchmarks.kora.prepare` and are never committed; KORA's terms permit research
# and benchmarking use of its package, which korabench.ai distributes. Only the five example
# rows are tracked, drawn from the least sensitive risks in the corpus.
*
!.gitignore
!example.jsonl
!example_metrics.json
!example_rollouts.jsonl
